+ * <p>{@link floydwarshall.format.DistanceMatrixFormatter} renders an
+ * {@link floydwarshall.algorithm.AllPairsShortestPaths} distance matrix as
+ * aligned text. Unreachable pairs are shown with a configurable token (default
